  "notes": "VERB TYPE:\n⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive) for visiting places/people\n⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive) for seasons/events arriving\n\nIchidan verb ({一段動詞|いちだんどうし}/{下一段|しもいちだん})\n\n- {訪|おとず}れない (negative)\n- {訪|おとず}れて (te-form)\n- {訪|おとず}れた (past)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{訪|たず}ねる→訪ねる：01182_tazuneru⟧ - to visit (also read たずねる)\n- ⟦{訪問|ほうもん}する→訪問する：26836_houmonsuru⟧ - to visit (formal)\n- ⟦{来|く}る→来る：00254_kuru⟧ - to come (general)\n\nUSAGE:\nMore literary and elegant than ⟦{訪|たず}ねる→訪ねる：01182_tazuneru⟧. Often used for the poetic sense of seasons or changes arriving.",
